sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant UI as Admin UI
    participant API as /api/admin/organizations
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant DBX as Databricks

    Note over Admin,DBX: 1. Organization Creation (Automated via UI)
    Admin->>UI: Click "New Organization"
    UI->>UI: Fill form (name, slug)
    UI->>API: POST /api/admin/organizations
    API->>DB: INSERT into organization table
    DB-->>API: Return new org record
    API-->>UI: Return organization
    UI-->>Admin: Show success

    Note over Admin,DBX: 2. Databricks Setup
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of Admin: Workspace must exist or be created
        alt Workspace does not exist
            Admin->>DBX: Create new Databricks workspace
            Note right of Admin: Manual step in Databricks console
        end
        Admin->>UI: Set workspace URL for organization
        UI->>API: PUT /api/admin/organizations (workspaceUrl)
        API->>DB: UPDATE organization SET workspaceUrl
        DB-->>API: Success
    end

    Note over Admin,DBX: 3. Workspace Setup (MANUAL)
    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
        Note right of Admin: These steps are NOT automated
        Admin->>DBX: Create Service Principal in Databricks
        Admin->>DBX: Grant SPN permissions to workspace
        Admin->>DBX: Create group for organization
        Admin->>DBX: Create catalog for organization
        Admin->>DBX: Grant catalog permissions to group
        Admin->>DBX: Create uploads schema and user volumes
        Admin->>DBX: Set up Delta Sharing (if needed)
    end

    Note over Admin,DBX: 4. FireFly Configuration (via Settings UI)
    Admin->>UI: Navigate to Settings > BYOD
    UI->>API: POST /api/sso-spn/byod/databricks/spns
    API->>DB: INSERT into byodDatabricksSpns

    Admin->>UI: Add workspace mapping
    UI->>API: POST /api/sso-spn/byod/databricks/workspaces
    API->>DB: INSERT into byodDatabricksWorkspaces

    Admin->>UI: Configure storage settings
    UI->>API: POST /api/sso-spn/storage-settings
    API->>DB: INSERT into organizationStorageSettings
    Note right of Admin: Set organization group + catalog
